<title>REPUBLIC OF IRELAND: Irish bond, equity turnover rises in May.</title>
<headline>Irish bond, equity turnover rises in May.</headline>
<dateline>DUBLIN 1997-06-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Equity turnover on the official list of the Irish Stock Exchange rose to 1.79 billion Irish pounds in May from 1.06 billion a month earlier, official figures showed on Tuesday.</p>
<p>Irish government bond turnover also increased, rising to 11.997 billion from 10.072 billion in April.</p>
<p>-- Dublin Newsroom +353 1 676 9779</p>
</text>
